      "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Education and resources</span><span class=\"futura-bold\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">to support your practice</span></span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">At Stryker Interventional Spine, we’re committed to delivering meaningful education that supports APPs in patient identification, confident clinical decision-making and improved patient access.<br>\n <br>\n Our goal is to ensure you have the right education and resources at your fingertips to drive confident decisions and meaningful patient outcomes.</span></p>\n",
